---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro'
import avatar from '../assets/photos/github-avatar.png'
---

<Layout
  title="About — Shintaro Jokagi"
  description="Japanese-Kiwi software engineer and open-source maintainer based in Auckland. Self-taught builder, Yamada UI maintainer, Zen Browser website architect."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap about-intro">
      <div class="about-intro-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
        <h1>
          A builder shaped by
          <span class="accent">movement</span>.
        </h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Born in Tokyo, grew up moving between Japan, the Philippines, and New
          Zealand. I taught myself to code, still get curious about random
          things, and I'm happiest when something I built actually helps
          someone.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-intro-visual">
        <div class="about-photo-stack">
          <figure class="about-photo about-photo--side">
            <Image
              src={avatar}
              alt="Shintaro Jokagi"
              width={460}
              height={460}
              loading="eager"
            />
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad about-body">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <article class="about-story prose">
        <h2>The path</h2>
        <p>
          I was born in 2005 in Tokyo. After the 2011 earthquake we moved to
          Ehime. Then a year at an Auckland intermediate, three months in Cebu
          studying English, a year at a British school in the Philippines, and
          back to New Zealand in 2019 — Westlake Boys, then University of
          Auckland.
        </p>
        <p>
          Along the way I tore my ACL three times playing football. The
          rehabilitation taught me patience, consistency, and how much of
          engineering — and life — is just showing up every day.
        </p>

        <h2>How I got into software</h2>
        <p>
          I started building in 2022 — typing games, small web apps, whatever I
          felt like shipping. Nobody taught me. By 2024 I was helping run an
          open-source design system, working on a browser website, and teaching
          Japanese kids to code in Minecraft over Zoom.
        </p>
        <p>
          That same year I joined the University of Auckland for a double major
          in Computer Science and IT Management, and started contributing to
          Yamada UI and Zen Browser in earnest.
        </p>

        <h2>What I do now</h2>
        <p>
          I'm a software engineer at <strong>Hazumi Inc.</strong>, building
          websites and product stuff remotely from Auckland for the Tokyo team.
          In open source I'm an official <strong>Yamada UI</strong> maintainer and
          the credited <strong>Core Website Architect</strong> for the Zen Browser
          website.
        </p>
        <p>
          I care a lot about the last 10% of a product — the empty states, the
          focus rings, the sentence that makes someone smile, the PR description
          that helps the next reviewer. Great software is mostly about people.
        </p>

        <h2>Outside of work</h2>
        <p>
          Kendama, juggling, table tennis, badminton, football, and the
          occasional very overengineered side project. I read a lot, write when
          I can, and compare browsers the way other people compare coffee shops.
        </p>

        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>
          Email me at
          <a href="mailto:taroj1205@gmail.com">taroj1205@gmail.com</a>
          or find me on
          <a
            href="https://github.com/taroj1205"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a
          >
          and
          <a
            href="https://x.com/taroj1205"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a
          >.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="about-aside">
        <div class="aside-card">
          <div class="eyebrow warm">Now</div>
          <h3>Auckland ↔ Tokyo</h3>
          <p>
            Software engineer at Hazumi Inc., remote from Auckland. Finishing a
            BSc in Computer Science + IT Management.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="aside-card">
          <div class="eyebrow">Open source</div>
          <h3>Tools other builders rely on</h3>
          <ul class="aside-list">
            <li>
              <strong>Yamada UI</strong>
              <span>Official maintainer</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Zen Browser</strong>
              <span>Core Website Architect</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>sonner</strong>
              <span>Feature shipped in v2.0.7</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="aside-card aside-card--photo">
          <Image
            src={avatar}
            alt="Shintaro Jokagi"
            width={460}
            height={460}
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .about-intro-copy h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6.5vw, 4.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-intro-copy .accent {
    color: var(--cobalt);
  }

  .about-photo-stack {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 420px;
  }

  .about-photo {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 22px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    background: var(--paper-deep);
  }

  .about-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-photo--main {
    width: 78%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .about-photo--side {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: 12%;
    width: 42%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    transform: rotate(3deg);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .about-photo--cert {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8%;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 48%;
    aspect-ratio: 5 / 4;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(260px, 0.7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-story {
    max-width: none;
  }

  .about-aside {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
  }

  .aside-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 1.35rem 1.4rem;
  }

  .aside-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
  }

  .aside-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .aside-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .aside-list li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(228, 220, 209, 0.8);
  }

  .aside-list li:first-child {
    padding-top: 0.35rem;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .aside-list strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .aside-list span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .aside-card--photo {
    padding: 0.55rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .aside-card--photo img {
    border-radius: 18px;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 11;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-intro,
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-intro-visual {
      order: -1;
    }

    .about-photo-stack {
      min-height: 340px;
      max-width: 480px;
    }

    .about-aside {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
